    "created_at": "2026-05-19T10:52:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-19T10:52:40Z",
    "body": "Looking at the working mode, specifically [this section](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#conflicts), I think it wouldn't be great to leave this as WICG or an implementation-defined thing given two shipping browsers.\nMaybe this should go to the steering group, or we can upstream it and webkit can decide to not implement, and bring a media-session based alternative in the future?\n\nGiven that this is shipped in both Chrome and Firefox, a new API is not likely to fully replace this and the community can benefit from it being part of the HTML standard despite not being implemented in all browsers.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
